OL,3,GNEWSAEvent shows historical house
OL,4,Arestoration works
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been invited to see how
OL,7,Fa historical Surrey house is being
OL,8,Frestored.
OL,10,FThe Grade I-listed Willmer House in
OL,11,FFarnham, built at the start of the 18th
OL,12,FCentury, had fallen into disrepair in
OL,13,Frecent years.
OL,15,FHowever, Waverley Borough Council has
OL,16,Fstarted a project to prevent the
OL,17,Fbuilding from collapsing, and turn it
OL,18,Finto a museum.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
